      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Even An Empress Needs Love</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Ruling an empire is hard work, as the Empress Despara has learned. Fortunately though, it helps to have a consort, loyal and loving, to help relieve the pressures of leadership once in a while. (Catradora, Canon Divergent AU, Smut)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
